<title>POLAND: Kety plans no 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>Kety plans no 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish aluminium plant Kety SA plans no 1996 dividend and wants to earmark all its last year's 29.2-million-zloty net profit for reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Kety said the management's proposal would be voted on at a general shareholders meeting on May 26.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
